{"speciesId":301,"names":{"fr":"Delcatty","es":"Delcatty","en":"Delcatty","ja":"エネコロロ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"DELCATTY prefers to live an unfettered existence in which it can do as it pleases at its own pace. Because this POKéMON eats and sleeps whenever it decides, its daily routines are completely random."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"DELCATTY sleeps anywhere it wants without keeping a permanent nest. If other POKéMON approach it as it sleeps, this POKéMON will never fight - it will just move away somewhere else."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Rather than keeping a permanent lair, it habitually seeks comfortable spots and sleeps there. It is nocturnal and becomes active at dusk."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"The favorite of trend-conscious female TRAINERS, they are used in competition for their style and fur."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"The favorite of trend-conscious female TRAINERS, they are used in competition for their style and fur."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It is highly popular among female Trainers for its sublime fur. It does not keep a nest."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It is highly popular among female Trainers for its sublime fur. It does not keep a nest."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is highly popular among female Trainers for its sublime fur. It does not keep a nest."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It dislikes dirty places. It often searches for a comfortable place in which to groom itself."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It dislikes dirty places. It often searches for a comfortable place in which to groom itself."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Les femmes Dresseurs raffolent de sa sublime fourrure. Il ne possède pas de nid."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is highly popular among female Trainers for its sublime fur. It does not keep a nest."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Les femmes Dresseurs raffolent de sa sublime fourrure. Il ne possède pas de nid."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is highly popular among female Trainers for its sublime fur. It does not keep a nest."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The reason it does not have a nest is that it simply searches for a clean, comfortable place then sleeps there."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The reason it does not have a nest is that it simply searches for a clean, comfortable place then sleeps there."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il déteste la saleté et passe son temps à entretenir sa fourrure, confortablement installé."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"No soporta los lugares sucios. Le encanta acicalarse el pelaje cuando está a gusto en un sitio."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It dislikes dirty places. It often searches for a comfortable place in which to groom itself."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"汚い 場所が 大嫌い。 居心地の 良い 場所で いつも 毛並みを 手入れしている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Les femmes Dresseurs raffolent de sa sublime fourrure. Il ne possède pas de nid."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Tiene mucho éxito entre las Entrenadoras por su suave pelaje. No vive en un sitio fijo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It is highly popular among female Trainers for its sublime fur. It does not keep a nest."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"美しい 毛並みを 持ち 女性トレーナーに 大人気。 決まった 住処を 持たない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Delcatty préfère vivre une existence sans contraintes, au cours de laquelle chacun pourrait faire ce qu’il veut. Comme ce Pokémon mange et dort quand il le décide, son rythme de vie est totalement aléatoire."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Delcatty prefiere llevar una vida independiente y hacer lo que se le antoje. Como este Pokémon come y duerme según vea en cada momento, no se puede decir que tenga unos hábitos regulares en el día a día."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Delcatty prefers to live an unfettered existence in which it can do as it pleases at its own pace. Because this Pokémon eats and sleeps whenever it decides, its daily routines are completely random."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"マイペースで 自由気ままな 暮らしを 好む。 気の向くまま エサを 食べたり 眠ったり しているので １日の リズムが バラバラだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Delcatty peut dormir n’importe où. Il n’a pas de nid permanent. Lorsque d’autres Pokémon lui cherchent des noises pendant son sommeil, il ne répond pas et se contente de partir dormir ailleurs."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Delcatty duerme en cualquier lugar sin tener que mantener el nido en un mismo sitio. Si otro Pokémon se le acerca mientras duerme, no se pondrá a luchar con él; simplemente se irá a otro sitio."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Delcatty sleeps anywhere it wants without keeping a permanent nest. If other Pokémon approach it as it sleeps, this Pokémon will never fight—it will just move away somewhere else."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"決まった すみかを 持たずに 暮らす ポケモン。 他の ポケモンが 寝床に 近寄って きても 決して 争わず 寝る 場所を 変える。"}],"varieties":[{"id":301,"moves":[{"name":"double-slap","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"tail-whip","learns":[[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"growl","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[1